      "extract": "arXiv:math/0401084v3 [math.GT] 9 Mar 2006 THE COLORED JONES POLYNOMIALS OF THE FIGURE-EIGHT KNOT AND ITS DEHN SURGERY SPACES HITOSHI MURAKAMI AND YOSHIYUKI YOKOTA Abstract. We calculate limits of the colored Jones polynomials of the ﬁgure- eight knot and conclude that in most cases they determine the volumes and the Chern–Simons invariants of the three-manifolds obtained by Dehn surgeries along it.",
