      ],
      "extract": "K. Habiro [@Habiro:SURIK00] and T. Le showed that the colored Jones polynomial $J_N(E;t)$ of the figure-eight knot $E$ is given as follows (see also [@Masbaum:AGT03]). $$\\label{eq:Jones} J_N(E;t)=\\sum_{n=0}^{N-1}\\prod_{k=1}^{n} t^N\\left(1-t^{-N-k}\\right)\\left(1-t^{-N+k}\\right).$$ We will study the asymptotic behavior of $J_N(E;q_r)$ with $q_r:=\\exp(2\\pi{r}\\sqrt{-1}/N)$ for large $N$. We approximate",
